"Before special Artonan healing, adults repeat a recitation after an Artonan official."
"They declare themselves citizens of Earth, a resource world under the empire's protection."
"They reaffirm the Contract: for all Earth gets, Artonans may take select warriors and attendants."
"The reciter then touches a glass panel that glows white for adults; children are too young."
"The System speaks aloud only in special places, such as these healing ceremonies."
